se customers, and businesses and consumers; and licenses its products to end-user customers through app stores and website at adobe.com. It markets and distributes its products through distributors, retailers, software developers, mobile app stores, systems integrators, independent software vendors, value-added resellers, and original equipment and hardware manufacturers. The company also provides an online visibility management and content marketing software-as-a-service platform. The company has a strategic alliance with HUMAIN for the development of generative AI models and AI-powered applications. The company was formerly known as Adobe Systems Incorporated and changed its name to Adobe Inc. in October 2018. Adobe Inc. was founded in 1982 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","employees":31360,"website":"https://www.adobe.com","country":"United States","city":"San Jose","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Shantanu  Narayen","title":"Chairman & CEO"},{"name":"Ms. Adele Louise  Pentland","title":"EVP of Legal & Government Relations, Chief Legal Officer and Corporate Secretary"},{"name":"Dr. Anil S. Chakravarthy","title":"President of Customer Experience Orchestration Business"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.39,"tpe":32.71,"ps":6.516,"pfcf":32.14,"peg":1.005,"pb":7.933,"rev_growth":0.215,"eps_growth":0.4515,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2552,"eps_growth_next":0.1933,"div_yield":0.0011,"roe":0.2323,"roa":0.07977,"de":47.91,"gross_margin":0.5924,"op_margin":0.225,"profit_margin":0.1914,"current_ratio":1.554},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":9.591,"sector":18.39,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":14.73,"sector":32.71,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.954,"sector":6.516,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":10.99,"sector":32.14,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.64,"sector":1.005,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":8.769,"sector":7.933,"verdi